Package: argusrm-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Description: Argus remote management server
 Argus enrolls managed machines, provides authenticated downloads, and
 coordinates remote management operations.

Package: argusrm-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Description: Argus remote management agent
 This package installs the agent on a managed Linux machine. Registration
 enables and starts its systemd or SysV service.

Package: argusrm-controller
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Argus controller
 This package contains the desktop and command-line controller. It enrolls
 with an Argus server, lists agents, and runs a command on one agent.
